node_modules/

# Browser profiles - match by SHAPE, never by name. ".gemini-sync-profile/"
# did not match ".gemini-sync-profile-brave/", and that one character published
# a 31MB Brave profile with history, cookies and saved logins.
*-sync-profile*/
*-sync-profile-*/
**/*sync-profile*/
**/user-data-dir/
**/playwright-profile*/
**/puppeteer_dev_*/
**/BrowserMetrics/
**/Crashpad/
**/Local State
**/Login Data
**/Login Data-journal
**/Web Data
**/Web Data-journal
**/Network/Cookies
**/Network/Cookies-journal

# Credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
.netrc
*.har
**/.claude/.credentials.json
**/.codex/auth.json
**/.grok/auth.json
**/oauth_creds.json

# Local snapshots and litter
usage-data.js
scratch/
test-results/
active-writes/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
